        {
          "id": "21557a04-bf5f-4de9-bc62-738fdeb03ceb:fact:1",
          "text": "Explicit disclosure: the objective is KL-regularized and induces a Gibbs policy over final actions under a Gaussian-smoothed behavior prior.",
          "citation": {
